{"product":{"id":8765302341920,"title":"Mazza Enduro","body_html":"Engineered for reliability, control, grip, and speed on mixed courses, the Mazza Enduro is the do-it-all tire for shuttle laps, timed gravity runs, and any time your day on the bike involves dicing technical terrain. Engineered with EWS-proven technology and designed to the specs of top athletes, the Mazza is equal to anything the trail can throw at it. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhile cornering or gripping off-camber rock faces, progressive siping on the shoulders varies the tread’s edges to balance responsive trail-feel with tenacious grab and no instability – glued, in control, and predictable. On climbs, the Mazza digs in with staircase leading edges that thrive on punchy rollers and technical rocky cruxes alike. Between the two, voracious spacing gobbles and clears loose, loamy soil and clingy muck.","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:13-05:00","handle":"mazza-enduro","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:43-05:00","published_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:13-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, Enduro\/Trail, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":46921114157344,"product_id":8765302341920,"title":"27.5x2.4 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"11A00279","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"27.5x2.4","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2023-10-09T04:30:13-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:43-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530023795","grams":1200,"image_id":43075575546144,"weight":1200.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":46921114222880,"product_id":8765302341920,"title":"27.5x2.6 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"1